---
import { API_SNIPPET, INSTALL } from "../lib/data";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<section class="section shell code" id="code" aria-labelledby="code-title">
  <div class="code__intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">Small interface. Explicit contracts.</span>
    <h2 id="code-title">Python at the edge.<br />Durability at the core.</h2>
    <p>Submit an ordered update. Wait for commit. Query a partner and its committed version. Keep the database when your process stops.</p>
    <ul><li>Bounded, thread-safe client admission</li><li>Deterministic Basic/Multilevel paper matching</li><li>SQLite recovery and exact retained retries</li></ul>
    <a class="text-link" href={`${base}/production/`}>Read the API contracts →</a>
    <p class="code__preview mono">ALPHA / INSTALL FROM SOURCE</p>
    <pre class="code__install" data-copy={INSTALL.pip}><code>{INSTALL.pip}</code></pre>
  </div>
  <div class="code__sample">
    <header class="mono"><span>service.py</span><span>Verified Python example</span></header>
    <pre data-verify="python" data-copy={API_SNIPPET}><code>{API_SNIPPET}</code></pre>
    <footer>Local component · GIL-enabled CPython · C++17 build required</footer>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .code { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr; gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px); align-items:center; padding-block:72px; }
  .code > * { min-width:0; }
  .code h2 { font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,44px); line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-.045em; margin:24px 0; }
  .code__intro > p { color:var(--ink-dim); font-size:16px; }
  .code ul { padding-left:18px; color:var(--ink-dim); font-size:14px; line-height:2; margin-block:24px; }
  .code .code__preview { margin-top:36px; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-faint); }
  .code__install { margin:12px 0 0; padding:18px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg-2); border-radius:8px; overflow-x:auto; font-size:11px; }
  .code__sample { border:1px solid var(--line-strong); background:var(--bg-2); border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; }
  .code__sample header { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; padding:16px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-dim); }
  .code__sample header span:last-child { color:var(--cobalt); }
  .code__sample pre { margin:0; padding:24px 20px 28px; overflow-x:auto; font:12px/1.85 var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink); }
  .code__sample footer { border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:14px 20px; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-faint); }
  @media(max-width:980px) { .code { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
